+--!strict
+-- The Ruinplate crown (a courtly gown of the Grashan ruins): a pale ruin-stone
+-- helm hugging the crown of the head, a coronet band and points that rise up
+-- rather than wide, and one centred crest rising from the cap, swept back and
+-- ridged in worn bronze so it reads as one deliberate shape from the front.
+-- A long moss veil falls down the back. Old bronze and moss over the pale
+-- stone, as the rest of the set.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+-- The Ruinplate palette: weathered pale stone, old bronze and moss.
+local stone = { 166, 162, 146 }
+local stoneDark = { 118, 115, 101 }
+local bronze = { 118, 94, 62 }
+local bronzeDark = { 84, 66, 46 }
